sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  Note over Browser,DB: Project: KursUmstufung | Ver: 1.0.4 | Date: 2026-06-12

  actor Browser as Lehrkraft / Schulleitung
  participant NC as Nextcloud Core
  participant Page as PageController
  participant Req as RequestController
  participant Auth as AuthorizationService
  participant Grp as IGroupManager / IConfig
  participant Svc as RequestService
  participant DB as Nextcloud DBAL

  Browser->>NC: Login (Nextcloud-Session)
  NC-->>Browser: Session-Cookie + requesttoken (CSRF)

  Browser->>NC: GET /apps/kursumstufung/ (Seite)
  NC->>Page: index() (@NoCSRFRequired)
  Page->>Auth: isSchulleitung()
  Auth->>Grp: isAdmin() / isInGroup(admin_group)
  Grp-->>Auth: true/false
  Auth-->>Page: Rolle
  Page-->>Browser: HTML + initial-state (Rolle, Faecher, Klassen)

  Browser->>NC: Axios GET /api/requests (mit Session + CSRF)
  NC->>NC: Auth- & CSRF-Pruefung
  NC->>Req: index()
  Req->>Auth: getUserId() / isSchulleitung()
  Auth-->>Req: userId, Rolle
  alt Schulleitung
    Req->>Svc: findAllSubmitted()
  else Lehrkraft
    Req->>Svc: findAllByUser(userId)
  end
  Svc->>DB: QueryBuilder (Prepared Statements)
  DB-->>Svc: Datensaetze
  Svc-->>Req: Anträge (rollen-gefiltert)
  Req-->>Browser: DataResponse JSON

  Note over Req,Svc: POST /api/requests/{id}/decide erzwingt serverseitig isSchulleitung() -> sonst 403
